abstract: "Public research archive and thin integration layer for the Human Motor Intelligence programme, including reproducibility infrastructure and the executed P6 studies: the C1 registered motor-imagery EEG-to-MyoSim replay (0/60 task successes), its post-hoc validity audit (endpoint unreachable by design) and the C2 registered episode-level follow-up (control success follows confidence-gate passage rather than decoder accuracy)."
